# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
storybook-static
*storybook.log

# Local verification scripts and screenshots (session scratch, never committed)
.verify-*.mjs
.verify-shots/
# scripts/ric10-live-check.ts's screenshots
.ric10/

# Throwaway design explorations and private notes
design-lab/
grant-pitch-review.md
scenario-review.md

# Internal product docs — kept locally, not published
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/` so the negation below can take effect — git does
# not descend into an excluded directory, so `!docs/buzz-compat/` would be
# ignored if the parent were excluded outright.
docs/*
# Exception: the Buzz/Nostr interop work is tracked — it holds working code
# (publish-to-relay.ts) and the interop evidence, not just prose.
!docs/buzz-compat/
# Exception: the debt list is a promise about this repository's code, and a
# promise nobody else can read is not one. Ship has carried its own since
# UIG-4; the gate checks every app runs name it (UIG-32).
!docs/GATES-DEBT.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# The manifest signing key (PRO-6). A secret; never committed.
.manifest-key

# The catalogue of Peek's parts (UIG-13): built from the code every time it is read,
# written to a file only by `npm run registry`, and never committed.
/registry.json
